  "historyNote": "#7636, eff 1-30-02, EXPIRED: 1-30-10 New. #10128, INTERIM, eff 5-16-12, EXPIRED: 11-13-12 New. #10340, eff 5-17-13; ss by #13811, eff 11-23-23",
